  lines:
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: "Ah, skepticism\u2014a necessary shield in a world of distortion. But even
      shields can block the light. Du\u010Di\u0107 would tell you that a nation\u2019s
      soul cannot be measured by doubt but by the daring to dream. Stay vigilant,
      Inspector, for sometimes, even echoes can carry the weight of truth."
